OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA fresh start in places this
OL,6,Fmorning with a mixture of cloud and
OL,7,Fsunny spells. The cloud may tend to
OL,8,Fthicken across parts of Cumbria later
OL,9,Fbut staying dry and bright elsewhere.
OL,10,FFeeling warm in the sunshine.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FA largely fine evening, but
OL,13,Fcloud will continue to thicken across
OL,14,FCumbria with patchy rain arriving
OL,15,Fhere. The rain will drift slowly
OL,16,Fsouthwards overnight but many southern
OL,17,Fareas staying dry.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
