OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CSunday:FA bright start in the south,
OL,6,Fotherwise a cloudier day than Saturday
OL,7,Fwith limited bright spells. Patchy
OL,8,Foutbreaks of rain also developing,
OL,9,Fespecially across Cumbria.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FHigh
OL,12,Fpressure will bring a settled few days
OL,13,Fwith plenty of sunshine across the
OL,14,Fregion. Feeling increasingly hot as
OL,15,Fthe week progresses with nights also
OL,16,Fbecome warmer.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
